msgid "Local correlation methods with pair natural orbitals (PNOs)"
msgstr "使用对自然轨道（PNO）的局域相关方法"

msgid ""
"In this page single-reference local correlation methods using pair natural "
"orbitals (PNOs) are described. This program is entirely distinct from the "
"older :doc:`PAO-based methods <pao-based_local_correlation_treatments>`. It "
"is designed for parallel execution both on one node and across multiple "
"nodes. By default, the program store some data in distributed memory, which "
"means more memory is required than in other programs. The memory required "
"per CPU core for these distributed data is approximately inversely linear in"
" the number of cores used. Therefore, it is normally not recommended using "
"these programs on a single core. Depending on the molecular size, "
"parallelization works well with up to 100-300 cores using multiple nodes, "
"provided that a fast network (Infiniband or similar) is available. "
"Calculations can also be performed with reasonable efficiency on one node "
"using disk storage instead of distributed memory when fast SSDs are used for"
" scratch."
msgstr ""
"本页描述使用对自然轨道（PNO）的单参考局域相关方法。本程序与较早的 :doc:`基于 PAO 的方法 <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments>` "
"完全不同。它设计用于在单节点和多节点上并行执行。默认情况下，程序将部分数据存储在分布式内存中，这意味着比其他程序需要更多内存。这些分布式数据每个 CPU"
" 核心所需的内存大致与使用的核心数成反比线性关系。因此，通常不建议在单核上使用这些程序。根据分子大小，在使用多个节点、最多 100-300 "
"个核心时，并行化效果良好，前提是有快速网络（Infiniband 或类似）。当使用快速 SSD "
"作为暂存时，也可以在一个节点上使用磁盘存储代替分布式内存以合理的效率进行计算。"

msgid ""
"The methods can be executed with or without explicitly correlated (F12) "
"terms. It is strongly recommended always to include F12, since this does not"
" only reduce the basis set errors, but also the domain errors."
msgstr "这些方法可以在包含或不包含显式相关（F12）项的情况下执行。强烈建议始终包含 F12，因为这不仅减少基组误差，还减少域误差。"

msgid ""
"Appropriate default values are set which normally yield results that are "
"close to the canonical ones. In particular, sub-kJ/mol accuracy of relative "
"energies is usually achieved with PNO-LMP2-F12 (relative to MP2-F12), and "
"sub-kcal/mol accuracy for PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 relative to CCSD(T)-F12."
msgstr ""
"设置了适当的默认值，通常产生接近正则值的结果。特别是，PNO-LMP2-F12（相对于 MP2-F12）通常可以达到亚 kJ/mol "
"的相对能量精度，PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 相对于 CCSD(T)-F12 可达到亚 kcal/mol 的精度。"

msgid ""
"We strongly recommend that the user reads the review `WIREs Comput. Mol. "
"Sci. <https://doi.org/10.1002/wcms.1371>`__ **8**, e1371 (2018) for the "
"concepts and local approximations used in the PNO program. More details on "
"the PNO methods can be found in `#bibliography "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#bibliography>`__."
" We kindly ask you to cite our original publications on the corresponding "
"methods in publications resulting from this program. **Please read the "
"important notes in `#getting started "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#getting-"
"started>`__ before attempting a PNO calculation!**"
msgstr ""
"我们强烈建议用户阅读综述 `WIREs Comput. Mol. Sci. <https://doi.org/10.1002/wcms.1371>`__"
" **8**, e1371 (2018) 以了解 PNO 程序中使用的概念和局域近似。关于 PNO 方法的更多细节可在 `#bibliography "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#bibliography>`__"
" 中找到。我们恳请您在使用本程序产生的出版物中引用我们关于相应方法的原始文献。\\ **在尝试 PNO 计算之前，请阅读 `#getting "
"started "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#getting-"
"started>`__ 中的重要说明！**"

msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "入门"

msgid "The program can be invoked using one of the following commands:"
msgstr "可以使用以下命令之一调用该程序："

msgid ""
"**``PNO-LMP2-F12``, *options*** runs a second order Møller Plesset "
"perturbation theory calculation."
msgstr "**``PNO-LMP2-F12``，*\\ 选项*** 运行二阶 Møller Plesset 微扰理论计算。"

msgid ""
"**``PNO-LCCSD-F12``, *options*** runs a local coupled cluster calculation "
"with single and double excitations."
msgstr "**``PNO-LCCSD-F12``，*\\ 选项*** 运行包含单双激发的局域耦合簇计算。"

msgid ""
"**``PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12``, *options*** runs a local coupled cluster calculation"
" with single, double, and perturbative triple excitations. ``(T)`` can be "
"replaced by ``(T0)`` or ``(T1)`` for reduced cost."
msgstr ""
"**``PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12``，*\\ 选项*** 运行包含单、双及微扰三重激发的局域耦合簇计算。为降低开销，\\ ``(T)`` "
"可替换为 ``(T0)`` 或 ``(T1)``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``PNO-LDCSD-F12``, *options*** runs a distinguishable cluster calculation "
"with single and double excitations."
msgstr "**``PNO-LDCSD-F12``，*\\ 选项*** 运行包含单双激发的可区分簇计算。"

msgid ""
"Available options are described `below "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#options>`__."
" ``F12`` in the above commands can be omitted for calculations without "
"explicit correlation. For coupled-cluster calculations the F12 variants are "
"strongly recommended due to the significantly improved accuracy and very "
"little added cost. The PNO program uses a different *Ansatz* from the "
"default one in the `canonical program "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#ccsd-t-f12>`__, and we recommend using "
"the more rigorous F12b approximation instead of F12a for all basis sets."
msgstr ""
"可用选项在 `下文 "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#options>`__ "
"中描述。对于不包含显式相关的计算，上述命令中的 ``F12`` 可以省略。对于耦合簇计算，由于精度显著提高且额外成本极小，强烈推荐使用 F12 "
"变体。PNO 程序使用的 *拟设* 与 `正则程序 <explicitly_correlated_methods.html#ccsd-t-f12>`__"
" 中的默认拟设不同，我们建议对所有基组使用更严格的 F12b 近似而非 F12a。"

msgid ""
"For Open-shell molecules (supported since Molpro 2020.1), LMP2 calculations "
"use the spin adapted theory described in `J. Chem. Theory Comput. "
"<https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jctc.8b01012>`__ **15**, 987 (2019), and "
"coupled cluster and distinguishable cluster calculations use the partially "
"spin-restricted theory (similar to the canonical ``RCCSD`` in Molpro) by "
"default. The command ``PNO-RCCSD`` is equivalent to to ``PNO-LCCSD``. Spin-"
"unrestricted CC or DC calculations can be performed using, for example, "
"``PNO-UCCSD``. Calculations on close-shell molecules will use the compatible"
" spin-free theories when the ``PNO-RCCSD`` or ``PNO-UCCSD`` command is "
"given."
msgstr ""
"对于开壳层分子（自 Molpro 2020.1 起支持），LMP2 计算使用 `J. Chem. Theory Comput. "
"<https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jctc.8b01012>`__ **15**, 987 (2019) "
"中描述的自旋适应理论，耦合簇和可区分簇计算默认使用部分自旋限制理论（类似于 Molpro 中的正则 ``RCCSD``\\ ）。命令 ``PNO-"
"RCCSD`` 等价于 ``PNO-LCCSD``\\ 。可以使用例如 ``PNO-UCCSD`` 进行自旋非限制 CC 或 DC 计算。当给出 "
"``PNO-RCCSD`` 或 ``PNO-UCCSD`` 命令时，闭壳层分子的计算将使用兼容的无自旋理论。"

msgid ""
"**It is important to check the following before attempting a PNO "
"calculation:**"
msgstr "**在尝试 PNO 计算之前，检查以下事项非常重要：**"

msgid ""
"Depending on the GA runtime, Larger PNO calculations may **require pre-"
"allocating GA memory** (shared or distributed memory). Please read `memory "
"specifications <running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#memory-"
"specifications>`__ for details. In single node calculations the `disk option"
" <local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#options-"
"for-job-execution>`__ can be considered."
msgstr ""
"取决于 GA 运行时，较大的 PNO 计算可能\\ **需要预分配 GA 内存**\\ （共享或分布式内存）。详情请阅读 `内存规范 "
"<running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#memory-specifications>`__\\ "
"。在单节点计算中，可以考虑 `磁盘选项 "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#options-for-"
"job-execution>`__\\ 。"

msgid ""
"Multi-node calculation over InfiniBand requires compiling Molpro from the "
"source code. Please refer to :doc:`GA Installation <ga_installation>` when "
"doing so."
msgstr ""
"通过 InfiniBand 进行多节点计算需要从源代码编译 Molpro。请参阅 :doc:`GA 安装 <ga_installation>`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"New releases may include some improvements that break backward "
"compatibility. Please check :doc:`recent changes <recent_changes>` when "
"upgrading. In particular, a new PNO-LCCSD program has been developed for "
"Molpro 2020.1 and the results are **not compatible with Molpro 2019.2 or "
"earlier** by default (see `#versions "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#versions>`__"
" for more details)."
msgstr ""
"新版本可能包含一些破坏向后兼容性的改进。升级时请检查 :doc:`最近更改 <recent_changes>`\\ 。特别是，为 Molpro "
"2020.1 开发了新的 PNO-LCCSD 程序，默认情况下结果\\ **与 Molpro 2019.2 或更早版本不兼容**\\ （详见 "
"`#versions "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#versions>`__\\"
" ）。"

msgid ""
"The PNO program requires a preceding Hartree–Fock calculation, and for the "
"F12 varieties the CABS singles correction should be included. The "
"Hartree–Fock calculation can be performed with the density-fitted HF program"
" (``DF-HF``) or a well-parallelized local variety of it (``LDF-HF``). If a "
"canonical F12 calculation is done before the PNO calculation, the CABS "
"singles correction is computed by default and is stored in Molpro variable "
"EF12_RHFRELAX and (from Molpro 2025.1) in the orbital dump record. If the "
"correction is available it will be added automatically added to the PNO "
"energies. The correction is remembered across restarts. However, it is "
"cleared whenever a new Hartree-Fock calculation is done. If variable "
"EF12_RHFRELAX is zero or not set, the CABS singles correction can be "
"computed in the PNO program by setting the option ``CABS_SINGLES=1`` (this "
"is possible only in closed-shell cases). Also in this case EF12_RHFRELAX is "
"set and remembered across restarts, so that in a restarted calculation the "
"CABS correction needs not to be computed again."
msgstr ""
"PNO 程序需要先进行 Hartree–Fock 计算，对于 F12 变体应包含 CABS 单激发修正。Hartree–Fock 计算可以使用密度拟合 "
"HF 程序（\\ ``DF-HF``\\ ）或其良好并行化的局域变体（\\ ``LDF-HF``\\ ）进行。如果在 PNO 计算之前进行了正则 F12"
" 计算，CABS 单激发修正默认计算并存储在 Molpro 变量 EF12_RHFRELAX 中，并且（从 Molpro 2025.1 "
"起）存储在轨道转储记录中。如果该修正可用，将自动添加到 PNO 能量中。该修正会在重启后保留。但是，每当进行新的 Hartree-Fock "
"计算时它会被清除。如果变量 EF12_RHFRELAX 为零或未设置，可以通过设置选项 ``CABS_SINGLES=1`` 在 PNO 程序中计算 "
"CABS 单激发修正（这仅在闭壳层情况下可行）。同样在这种情况下，EF12_RHFRELAX 会被设置并在重启后保留，因此在重启计算中无需再次计算 "
"CABS 修正。"

msgid "A typical input including CABS singles correction is"
msgstr "包含 CABS 单激发修正的典型输入为"

msgid ""
"**\\*\\* Note:** Computations of the cabs correction are not well suited for"
" multi-node calculations (``but see below for Molpro version 2025.3 and "
"later``). They may become slow and require too much GA space. It may "
"therefore be advantageous to carry out these calculations separately on a "
"single node. This can be done with"
msgstr ""
"**\\*\\* 注意：** CABS 修正的计算不太适合多节点计算（\\ ``但请参阅下文关于 Molpro 2025.3 及更高版本的内容``\\ "
"）。它们可能变慢并需要过多 GA 空间。因此，在单个节点上单独进行这些计算可能更有利。这可以通过以下方式完成"

msgid ""
"In this case the CABS correction is computed and available after a restart. "
"Note that the calculation of the cabs correction on a single node may "
"require a lot of memory (in particular for open-shell) but less GA than a "
"PNO calculation. It is therefore generally recommended to compute the cabs "
"correction in a separate calculation. See also below regarding OPTRI basis "
"sets."
msgstr ""
"在这种情况下，CABS 修正被计算并在重启后可用。请注意，在单个节点上计算 CABS 修正可能需要大量内存（特别是对于开壳层），但需要的 GA 少于 "
"PNO 计算。因此，通常建议在单独的计算中计算 CABS 修正。关于 OPTRI 基组另请参阅下文。"

msgid ""
"``However, from Molpro 2025.3 and later, the CABS program has been improved "
"and also runs efficiently in parallel on multiple nodes. It is therefore "
"computed automatically in the PNO program (only with F12)  unless already "
"available.`` In order to save computation time, a slightly simplified method"
" for computing the CABS basis is used (ORTHO_CABS=0). Extensive tests have "
"shown that this has only a negligible effect on relative energies. However, "
"it is possible to set PNO option ``ORTHO_CABS=1`` in order to generate the "
"CABS correction exactly as with DF-CABS (which uses  ORTHO_CABS=1 by "
"default). Furthermore, one can use PNO option ``CABS_SINGLES=0`` to disable "
"the automatic computation of the CABS correction or ``CABS_SINGLES=2`` to "
"force recalculating it even if it is already available."
msgstr ""
"``然而，从 Molpro 2025.3 及更高版本起，CABS 程序已得到改进，并且可以在多个节点上高效并行运行。因此，除非已经可用，它会在 PNO "
"程序中自动计算（仅在使用 F12 时）。`` 为节省计算时间，使用了一种稍简化的 CABS "
"基组计算方法（ORTHO_CABS=0）。广泛测试表明，这对相对能量的影响可以忽略不计。然而，可以设置 PNO 选项 ``ORTHO_CABS=1`` "
"以便以与 DF-CABS 完全相同的方式生成 CABS 修正（DF-CABS 默认使用 ORTHO_CABS=1）。此外，可以使用 PNO 选项 "
"``CABS_SINGLES=0`` 禁用 CABS 修正的自动计算，或使用 ``CABS_SINGLES=2`` 强制重新计算，即使它已经可用。"

msgid ""
"By default, the program uses as RI basis the JKFIT basis corresponding to "
"the orbital basis set. It is strongly recommended to use orbital basis sets "
"that include diffuse functions, e.g. aug-cc-pVTZ or cc-pVTZ-F12 (diffuse "
"functions can be omitted on hydrogen atoms). The cc-pVnZ-F12 basis sets "
"(short names: vnz-f12) [see `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2831537>`__ **128**, 084102 (2008), `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3308483>`__ **132**, 054108 (2010), "
"`Phys. Chem. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1039/C0CP00020E>`__ **12**, "
"10460 (2010)] are particularly well suited. Furthermore, the RI basis should"
" at least have triple-zeta quality, if JKFIT sets are used for this purpose."
" Errors of several kcal/mol in relative energies can occur if e.g. "
"``ri_basis=vdz`` is used. Thus, with a double-zeta orbital basis, the RI-"
"basis should be specified using the ``ri_basis`` option, e.g.:"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，程序使用与轨道基组对应的 JKFIT 基组作为 RI 基组。强烈建议使用包含弥散函数的轨道基组，例如 aug-cc-pVTZ 或 cc-"
"pVTZ-F12（氢原子上可以省略弥散函数）。cc-pVnZ-F12 基组（短名称：vnz-f12）[见 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2831537>`__ **128**, 084102 (2008), `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3308483>`__ **132**, 054108 (2010), "
"`Phys. Chem. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1039/C0CP00020E>`__ **12**, "
"10460 (2010)] 特别适合。此外，如果为此目的使用 JKFIT 基组，RI 基组至少应具有三ζ质量。如果例如使用 "
"``ri_basis=vdz``\\ ，可能会出现几 kcal/mol 的相对能量误差。因此，对于双ζ轨道基组，应使用 ``ri_basis`` "
"选项指定 RI 基组，例如："

msgid ""
"Both F12 calculations use the basis sets specified on the explicit "
"directive, which must be given before the first F12 calculation in the "
"input. Note that specifications on an ``explicit`` directive are not "
"remembered in restarts and must therefore be given again after a restart."
msgstr ""
"两个 F12 计算都使用在 ``explicit`` 指令上指定的基组，该指令必须在输入中第一次 F12 计算之前给出。请注意，\\ "
"``explicit`` 指令上的规格不会在重启中保留，因此必须在重启后再次给出。"

msgid ""
"An alternative, usually somewhat more expensive choice is to use the "
"optimized RI basis sets of Peterson et al. (see `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4893989>`__ **141**, 094106 (2014) and "
"references therein). In this case the RI basis is generated as then union of"
" the orbital basis and the optri basis. In Molpro, this is done "
"automatically by specifying, e.g. ``vdz-f12/cabs``."
msgstr ""
"另一种通常稍贵的选择是使用 Peterson 等人的优化 RI 基组（见 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4893989>`__ **141**, 094106 (2014) "
"及其中的参考文献）。在这种情况下，RI 基组生成为轨道基组和 optri 基组的并集。在 Molpro 中，通过指定例如 "
"``vdz-f12/cabs`` 自动完成。"

msgid ""
"**Warning: Do not define the RI basis for PNO calculation with the `context "
"<basis_input.html#auxiliary-basis-sets-for-density-fitting-or-resolution-of-"
"the-identity>`__ ``optri``.** This will lead to very large errors. The "
"``cabs`` context should be used instead. If such cabs RI basis sets are "
"used, the cabs-singles correction should not be computed within the PNO "
"program, but beforehand using df-mp2-f12,cabs_singles=-1 (see above). The "
"latter method can use the proper CABS approach, with is numerically more "
"stable."
msgstr ""
"**警告：不要使用 `上下文 <basis_input.html#auxiliary-basis-sets-for-density-fitting-"
"or-resolution-of-the-identity>`__ ``optri`` 为 PNO 计算定义 RI 基组。** "
"这将导致非常大的误差。应改用 ``cabs`` 上下文。如果使用这样的 cabs RI 基组，则不应在 PNO 程序内计算 cabs-"
"单激发修正，而应事先使用 df-mp2-f12,cabs_singles=-1（见上文）。后一种方法可以使用适当的 CABS 方法，数值上更稳定。"

msgid ""
"Local coupled cluster calculations on large molecules require a significant "
"amount of memory. The memory requirements of the PNO program consist of two "
"parts:"
msgstr "大分子上的局域耦合簇计算需要大量内存。PNO 程序的内存需求由两部分组成："

msgid ""
"*Local memory*: the memory for each CPU core allocated using the ``memory`` "
"card in the input file or the -m option on the molpro command line. This is "
"primarily used for scratch storage of data, and the usage per core is "
"roughly invariant with the number of cores."
msgstr ""
"*局域内存*\\ ：每个 CPU 核心的内存，通过输入文件中的 ``memory`` 卡片或 molpro 命令行上的 -m "
"选项分配。这主要用于数据的暂存存储，每个核心的使用量大致与核心数无关。"

msgid ""
"*Distributed memory*: the memory used to store large data structure that are"
" shared by all processors. The usage per core is roughly inversely linear in"
" the number of cores. By default it is implemented with the ``globalarrays``"
" (GA) toolkit, but it is also possible to use disk storage (with the "
"``implementation=disk`` option) when the program is executed on one node."
msgstr ""
"*分布式内存*\\ ：用于存储所有处理器共享的大数据结构的内存。每个核心的使用量大致与核心数成反比线性关系。默认情况下使用 "
"``globalarrays``\\ （GA）工具包实现，但当程序在单个节点上执行时，也可以使用磁盘存储（使用 "
"``implementation=disk`` 选项）。"

msgid ""
"Some typical memory usage can be found in `WIREs Comput. Mol. Sci. "
"<https://doi.org/10.1002/wcms.1371>`__ **8**, e1371. Unless the disk storage"
" option is given, one should not allocate all available physical memory "
"using the ``memory`` command in an input file, so that the GA toolkit could "
"allocate sufficient memory when needed. In large cases it may be necessary "
"to pass the ``-G [ga_mem]`` option in the molpro command line. This allows "
"the allocation of ``ga_mem`` megawords of memory (all cores in total) for GA"
" at the beginning of execution. Without doing this, GA may crash when the "
"distributed data structures get large, most likely due to an upstream bug. "
"More information about memory and GA allocation is given in sections `GA "
"Installation notes <running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#ga-"
"installation-notes>`__ and `memory specifications "
"<running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#memory-specifications>`__. Please"
" read these sections carefully before starting large-scale calculations."
msgstr ""
"一些典型的内存使用情况可在 `WIREs Comput. Mol. Sci. "
"<https://doi.org/10.1002/wcms.1371>`__ **8**, e1371 "
"中找到。除非给出磁盘存储选项，否则不应使用输入文件中的 ``memory`` 命令分配所有可用的物理内存，以便 GA "
"工具包在需要时能够分配足够的内存。在大规模情况下，可能需要在 molpro 命令行中传递 ``-G [ga_mem]`` 选项。这允许在执行开始时为 "
"GA 分配 ``ga_mem`` 兆词的内存（所有核心总计）。如果不这样做，当分布式数据结构变大时 GA 可能会崩溃，最可能由于上游错误。关于内存和 "
"GA 分配的更多信息在 `GA 安装说明 <running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#ga-"
"installation-notes>`__ 和 `内存规范 "
"<running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#memory-specifications>`__ "
"章节中给出。在开始大规模计算之前，请仔细阅读这些章节。"

msgid ""
"When using the ``implementation=disk`` option, allocating memory for GA is "
"not necessary. However it only supports calculations on a single node. Also "
"be aware that the program is not specifically optimized for disk operations,"
" and it requires fast SSDs for optimal performance."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``implementation=disk`` 选项时，不需要为 GA "
"分配内存。然而它仅支持单节点计算。另请注意，该程序并未针对磁盘操作进行专门优化，并且需要快速 SSD 才能获得最佳性能。"

msgid "Versions"
msgstr "版本"

msgid ""
"In Molpro 2020.1 we have made a major revision to the PNO-LCCSD program to "
"support open-shell molecules. Some changes in the local approximations and "
"default program settings have been applied. **The computed energies will not"
" be identical to those obtained with earlier versions of Molpro.**"
msgstr ""
"在 Molpro 2020.1 中，我们对 PNO-LCCSD 程序进行了重大修订，以支持开壳层分子。对局域近似和默认程序设置进行了一些更改。\\ "
"**计算得到的能量将与早期版本的 Molpro 所得结果不完全相同。**"

msgid "**The option version=2019.2 is no longer available.**"
msgstr "**选项 version=2019.2 不再可用。**"

msgid "Default and tight settings"
msgstr "默认与严格设置"

msgid ""
"In most cases the recommended default values should be sufficient and "
"provide chemical accuracy for relative energies. In cases of doubt or to "
"benchmark the accuracy of the local approximations, ``TIGHT`` presets can be"
" chosen using one of the following options:"
msgstr ""
"在大多数情况下，推荐的默认值应该足够，并为相对能量提供化学精度。在有疑问的情况下，或为了基准测试局域近似的精度，可以使用以下选项之一选择 "
"``TIGHT`` 预设："

msgid "``DOMOPT=TIGHT`` Use tight domain approximations."
msgstr "``DOMOPT=TIGHT`` 使用严格的域近似。"

msgid "``PAIROPT=TIGHT`` Use tight pair approximations."
msgstr "``PAIROPT=TIGHT`` 使用严格的对近似。"

msgid ""
"In most cases, the domain approximations causes the largest errors, in "
"particular in PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 calculations, and if very high accuracy is "
"required or in cases of doubt ``DOMOPT=TIGHT`` should be tried first. This "
"also reduces the errors of the projection approximations, which depend on "
"the domain sizes. Note, however, the calculations with ``TIGHT`` settings "
"are much more demanding than with ``DEFAULT`` options regarding CPU time and"
" memory. For intermolecular interactions, we recommend ``DOMOPT=TIGHT, "
"THRPNO_EN_CC=0.997``. Alternatively, ``DOMOPT=VTIGHT`` can be used, but this"
" leads to a significant further increase of the computational cost."
msgstr ""
"在大多数情况下，域近似会导致最大的误差，特别是在 PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 计算中，如果需要非常高的精度或有疑问，应首先尝试 "
"``DOMOPT=TIGHT``\\ 。这也会减小投影近似的误差，而该误差取决于域的大小。但请注意，与 ``DEFAULT`` 选项相比，使用 "
"``TIGHT`` 设置的计算在 CPU 时间和内存方面要求高得多。对于分子间相互作用，我们推荐 ``DOMOPT=TIGHT, "
"THRPNO_EN_CC=0.997``\\ 。或者，可以使用 ``DOMOPT=VTIGHT``\\ ，但这会导致计算成本进一步显著增加。"

msgid ""
"For a detailed description of all options see the `original publications "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#bibliography>`__."
msgstr ""
"有关所有选项的详细说明，请参见 `原始出版物 "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#bibliography>`__\\"
" 。"

