msgid ""
"Additional domain selection options ``DEFAULT+`` and ``TIGHT+`` are provided"
" since Molpro 2025.3. ``DEFAULT+`` differs from DEFAULT by increasing "
"**REXT=5** to **REXT=7**. ``TIGHT+`` differs from TIGHT by increasing "
"**THREN_CC** from **0.990 to 0.997**. For highly accurate calculations of "
"interaction energies we recommend the options ``DOMOPT=TIGHT, "
"DOMOPT_INTMOL=TIGHT+``. Nearly as accurate but less expensive are options "
"``DOMOPT=DEFAULT+, DOMOPT_INTMOL=TIGHT+``. See  `J. Phys. Chem. A 129, 4812 "
"(2025) <https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpca.5c02316>`__ for benchmarks."
msgstr ""
"自 Molpro 2025.3 起提供了额外的域选择选项 ``DEFAULT+`` 和 ``TIGHT+``\\ 。\\ ``DEFAULT+`` 与 "
"DEFAULT 的区别在于将 **REXT=5** 增大到 **REXT=7**\\ 。\\ ``TIGHT+`` 与 TIGHT 的区别在于将 "
"**THREN_CC** 从 **0.990 增大到 0.997**\\ 。对于高精度相互作用能计算，我们推荐使用选项 ``DOMOPT=TIGHT, "
"DOMOPT_INTMOL=TIGHT+``\\ 。精度接近但开销更低的选项是 ``DOMOPT=DEFAULT+, "
"DOMOPT_INTMOL=TIGHT+``\\ 。基准测试参见 `J. Phys. Chem. A 129, 4812 (2025) "
"<https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpca.5c02316>`__\\ 。"

msgid "Directives"
msgstr "指令"

msgid ""
"The usual ``OCC``, ``CORE``, ``CLOSED``, and ``WF`` directives can be given."
" Normally, this is not needed since the information can be recovered from "
"the orbital dump file. Local options can be given on the command line or on "
"a ``LOCAL`` directive. Options form explicit can also be given either on the"
" command line or on an ``EXPLICIT`` directive. For ``REGION`` input see "
"section [[#Correlation_regions_in_the_PNO_program_[region]\\|Correlation "
"regions]]."
msgstr ""
"可以给出通常的 ``OCC``\\ 、\\ ``CORE``\\ 、\\ ``CLOSED`` 和 ``WF`` "
"指令。通常不需要这样做，因为这些信息可以从轨道转储文件中恢复。局域选项可以在命令行或 ``LOCAL`` 指令上给出。显式选项也可以在命令行或 "
"``EXPLICIT`` 指令上给出。关于 ``REGION`` 输入，请参见 "
"[[#Correlation_regions_in_the_PNO_program_[region]\\|Correlation regions]] "
"一节。"

msgid "\\* ``INTERACT``, ``MERGE=[list of molecules]``"
msgstr "\\* ``INTERACT``\\ ，\\ ``MERGE=[分子列表]``"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

msgid ""
"In this section we describe the parameters most relevant to the accuracy and"
" performance of the PNO program. We note that our team has carefully "
"selected the default options through benchmark calculations, and the options"
" only need to be modified for special cases."
msgstr ""
"在本节中，我们介绍与 PNO 程序的精度和性能最为相关的参数。请注意，我们的团队已通过基准计算仔细选择了默认选项，只有在特殊情况下才需要修改这些选项。"

msgid "Options for job execution"
msgstr "作业执行选项"

msgid ""
"**``IMPLEMENTATION``\\ =\\ ``GA|DISK``** Choose whether large data "
"structures are stored in distributed memory (default) or disk. **Do not use "
"the ``-G`` or ``-M`` options to preallocate GA in calculations using the "
"disk implementation!** Please check the `notes on the disk option "
"<running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#notes-on-the-disk-option>`__."
msgstr ""
"**``IMPLEMENTATION``\\ =\\ ``GA|DISK``** 选择大型数据结构存储在分布式内存（默认）还是磁盘中。\\ "
"**在使用磁盘实现的计算中，请勿使用 ``-G`` 或 ``-M`` 选项预分配 GA！** 请查看 `关于磁盘选项的说明 "
"<running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#notes-on-the-disk-option>`__\\ 。"

msgid ""
"The program is generally optimized for using GA, but the disk option can be "
"used in single-node calculations that would otherwise require too much "
"memory."
msgstr "该程序通常针对使用 GA 进行了优化，但磁盘选项可用于单节点计算，而这类计算原本会需要过多内存。"

msgid ""
"Also, in single-node calculations ``implementation=disk`` with the global "
"scratch set to a tmpfs (e.g., with ``-D /dev/shm``) can be efficient. Do "
"note that when ``-D /dev/shm`` and ``implementation=disk`` is used on nodes "
"with a physical disk, the options ``PNO_3EXTK_IMPL=4, PNO_4EXTK_IMPL=4`` can"
" be given to save some less frequently accessed data to the physical disk "
"(with path defined by the ``-d`` command line option) to reduce the memory "
"usage."
msgstr ""
"此外，在单节点计算中，若将全局暂存目录设置为 tmpfs（例如使用 ``-D /dev/shm``\\ ），\\ "
"``implementation=disk`` 也可能很高效。请注意，当在具有物理磁盘的节点上使用 ``-D /dev/shm`` 和 "
"``implementation=disk`` 时，可以给出选项 ``PNO_3EXTK_IMPL=4, PNO_4EXTK_IMPL=4``\\ "
"，将一些访问频率较低的数据保存到物理磁盘（路径由 ``-d`` 命令行选项定义），以减少内存使用。"

msgid "Options for PAO/OSV/PNO generation"
msgstr "PAO/OSV/PNO 生成选项"

msgid ""
"**``THRLMO``\\ =\\ *value*** Charge threshold for selection of primary PAO "
"domains when using IBOs or NBOs (default 0.2). For open-shell orbitals the "
"threshold is divided by 2. If the threshold is larger than the largest "
"partial charge cmax of an orbital, it is reduced to cmax\\*0.9 for this "
"orbital."
msgstr ""
"**``THRLMO``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 使用 IBO 或 NBO 时选择主 PAO 域的电荷阈值（默认 "
"0.2）。对于开壳层轨道，该阈值除以 2。如果阈值大于某轨道的最大部分电荷 cmax，则对该轨道将其减小为 cmax\\*\\ 0.9。"

msgid ""
"**``THRLMO_ACT``\\ =\\ *value*** Charge threshold for selection of primary "
"PAO domains when using IBOs or NBOs for active (open-shell) orbitals "
"(default THRLMO)."
msgstr ""
"**``THRLMO_ACT``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 使用 IBO 或 NBO 时，为活性（开壳层）轨道选择主 PAO "
"域的电荷阈值（默认为 THRLMO）。"

msgid ""
"**``IEXT``\\ =\\ *value*** Domain extension using connectivity. *value* "
"corresponds to the number of bonds by which the primary domains are "
"extended."
msgstr "**``IEXT``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 利用连通性扩展域。*\\ value* 表示主域扩展的键数。"

msgid ""
"**``REXT``\\ =\\ *value*** Domain extension using distance. *value* is the "
"radius in :math:`a_0` from any atom in the primary domain. ``IEXT`` and "
"``REXT`` can be combined. If both are given all atoms are included that are "
"selected by one or the other criterion."
msgstr ""
"**``REXT``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 利用距离扩展域。*\\ value* 是以 :math:`a_0` "
"为单位的半径，从主域中任意原子起算。\\ ``IEXT`` 和 ``REXT`` 可以组合使用。若同时给出，则包含由任一判据选中的所有原子。"

msgid ""
"**``THROSV``\\ =\\ *threshold*** OSV selection threshold based on natural "
"occupation numbers."
msgstr "**``THROSV``\\ =\\ *\\ threshold*** 基于自然占据数的 OSV 选择阈值。"

msgid ""
"**``THRPNO_OCC_LMP2``\\ =\\ *threshold*** PNO selection threshold for LMP2 "
"based on natural occupation numbers. It is also possible to specify 3 values"
" for strong+close, weak, and distant pairs as ``THRPNO_OCC_LMP2``\\ "
"=[*thrstrong, thrweak, thrdist*]. ``THRPNO_LMP2`` is an alias for "
"``THRPNO_OCC_LMP2``."
msgstr ""
"**``THRPNO_OCC_LMP2``\\ =\\ *\\ threshold*** 基于自然占据数的 LMP2 PNO "
"选择阈值。也可以为强+近、弱和远对分别指定 3 个值，形式为 ``THRPNO_OCC_LMP2``\\ =[*\\ thrstrong, "
"thrweak, thrdist*]。\\ ``THRPNO_LMP2`` 是 ``THRPNO_OCC_LMP2`` 的别名。"

msgid ""
"**``THRPNO_EN_LMP2``\\ =\\ *threshold*** PNO selection threshold for LMP2 "
"based on the energy criterion. ``THREN_LMP2`` is an alias for "
"``THRPNO_EN_LMP2``."
msgstr ""
"**``THRPNO_EN_LMP2``\\ =\\ *\\ threshold*** 基于能量判据的 LMP2 PNO 选择阈值。\\ "
"``THREN_LMP2`` 是 ``THRPNO_EN_LMP2`` 的别名。"

msgid ""
"**``THRPNO_OCC_CC``\\ =\\ *threshold*** PNO selection threshold for LCCSD "
"based on occupation numbers. ``THRPNO_CC`` is an alias for "
"``THRPNO_OCC_CC``."
msgstr ""
"**``THRPNO_OCC_CC``\\ =\\ *\\ threshold*** 基于占据数的 LCCSD PNO 选择阈值。\\ "
"``THRPNO_CC`` 是 ``THRPNO_OCC_CC`` 的别名。"

msgid ""
"**``THRPNO_EN_CC``\\ =\\ *threshold*** PNO selection threshold for LCCSD "
"based on the energy criterion. ``THREN_CC`` is an alias for "
"``THRPNO_EN_CC``."
msgstr ""
"**``THRPNO_EN_CC``\\ =\\ *\\ threshold*** 基于能量判据的 LCCSD PNO 选择阈值。\\ "
"``THREN_CC`` 是 ``THRPNO_EN_CC`` 的别名。"

msgid ""
"``SORTPNO`` If this option is given, PNOs are first selected using the "
"occupation number criterion. Then PNOs are added in the order of decreasing "
"semi-canonical energy contributions until the energy completeness criterion "
"is satisfied. Without this option, PNOs are added in the order of decreasing"
" occupation numbers. In some cases, SORTPNO significantly reduces the PNO "
"domain sizes. The default since Molpro version 2025.3 is  ``SORTPNO=1``. For"
" compatibility with older program versions, set ``SORTPNO=0``."
msgstr ""
"``SORTPNO`` 若给出此选项，则首先使用占据数判据选择 PNO。然后按照半正则能量贡献递减的顺序添加 "
"PNO，直至满足能量完备性判据。若不使用此选项，则按照占据数递减的顺序添加 PNO。在某些情况下，SORTPNO 可显著减小 PNO 域的大小。自 "
"Molpro 2025.3 版本起默认为 ``SORTPNO=1``\\ 。为兼容旧版本程序，可设置 ``SORTPNO=0``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``EPNO_MIN``\\ =\\ *value*** PNOs which have semi-canonical energy "
"contributions smaller than the given value are omitted. The default is "
"EPNO_MIN=0."
msgstr "**``EPNO_MIN``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 半正则能量贡献小于给定值的 PNO 将被省略。默认值为 EPNO_MIN=0。"

msgid ""
"Note that in LCCSD calculations the thresholds ``THRPNO_OCC_LMP2`` and "
"``THRPNO_EN_LMP2`` only affect the LMP2 domain corrections. The thresholds "
"``THRPNO_OCC_CC`` must not be smaller and ``THRPNO_EN_CC`` not be larger "
"than the corresponding LMP2 thresholds. Thus, the LCCSD domains are always "
"smaller or equal to the LMP2 ones. PNOs are added to the domains until both "
"the occupation number and energy criteria are fulfilled."
msgstr ""
"注意，在 LCCSD 计算中，阈值 ``THRPNO_OCC_LMP2`` 和 ``THRPNO_EN_LMP2`` 仅影响 LMP2 域校正。阈值 "
"``THRPNO_OCC_CC`` 不得小于、\\ ``THRPNO_EN_CC`` 不得大于相应的 LMP2 阈值。因此，LCCSD 域始终小于或等于"
" LMP2 域。PNO 被添加到域中，直至占据数判据和能量判据均得到满足。"

msgid "Options for pair approximations"
msgstr "对近似的选项"

msgid ""
"In the PNO-LCCSD program the pairs are classified according to the LMP2 pair"
" energies into strong, close, weak, distant and very distant pairs. Close "
"pairs are treated by approximate CCSD, in which terms that cancel at long-"
"range are neglected. Weak pairs are treated with the same approximations as "
"close pairs, but in addition terms that are non-linear in the amplitudes are"
" neglected (CEPA). Distant pairs are approximated by the iterative SCS-LMP2 "
"multipole approximation. Very distant pairs are treated by the semi-"
"canonical SCS-LMP2 (non-iterative) multipole approximation."
msgstr ""
"在 PNO-LCCSD 程序中，对儿根据 LMP2 对能量分为强、近、弱、远和极远对。近对采用近似 CCSD "
"处理，其中忽略了长程相消的项。弱对采用与近对相同的近似处理，但另外忽略了振幅中非线性的项（CEPA）。远对采用迭代 SCS-LMP2 "
"多极近似。极远对采用半正则 SCS-LMP2（非迭代）多极近似处理。"

msgid ""
"**``THRCLOSE``\\ =\\ *thrclose*** Pairs with PNO-LMP2 energies "
":math:`thrclose \\ge E_{ij} \\gt thrweak` are treated as close pairs."
msgstr ""
"**``THRCLOSE``\\ =\\ *\\ thrclose*** PNO-LMP2 能量满足 :math:`thrclose \\ge "
"E_{ij} \\gt thrweak` 的对儿被视为近对。"

msgid ""
"**``THRWEAK``\\ =\\ *thrweak*** Pairs with PNO-LMP2 energies :math:`thrweak "
"\\ge E_{ij} \\gt thrdist` are treated as weak pairs."
msgstr ""
"**``THRWEAK``\\ =\\ *\\ thrweak*** PNO-LMP2 能量满足 :math:`thrweak \\ge E_{ij} "
"\\gt thrdist` 的对儿被视为弱对。"

msgid ""
"**``THRDIST``\\ =\\ *thrdist*** Pairs with PNO-LMP2 energies :math:`thrdist "
"\\ge E_{ij} \\gt thrvdist` are treated as distant pairs."
msgstr ""
"**``THRDIST``\\ =\\ *\\ thrdist*** PNO-LMP2 能量满足 :math:`thrdist \\ge E_{ij} "
"\\gt thrvdist` 的对儿被视为远对。"

msgid ""
"**``THRVDIST``\\ =\\ *thrvdist*** Pairs with PNO-LMP2 energies "
":math:`thrvdist \\ge E_{ij}` are treated as very distant pairs."
msgstr ""
"**``THRVDIST``\\ =\\ *\\ thrvdist*** PNO-LMP2 能量满足 :math:`thrvdist \\ge "
"E_{ij}` 的对儿被视为极远对。"

msgid "Options for triples calculation"
msgstr "三激发行计算的选项"

msgid ""
"The **domain approximations in (T)** calculations are controlled by the "
"following options:"
msgstr "**(T)** 计算中的\\ **域近似**\\ 由以下选项控制："

msgid ""
"**``THRTNO_T0``\\ =\\ *value*** Occupation number threshold for selecting "
"triples domains for the non-iterative (T0) approximation."
msgstr "**``THRTNO_T0``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 用于为非迭代 (T0) 近似选择三激发行域的占据数阈值。"

msgid ""
"**``THRTNO_T``\\ =\\ *value*** Occupation number threshold for selecting "
"triples domains for the iterative (T) approximation. Note that decreasing "
"``THRTNO_T`` will lead to significantly increased GA usage."
msgstr ""
"**``THRTNO_T``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 用于为迭代 (T) 近似选择三激发行域的占据数阈值。注意，减小 "
"``THRTNO_T`` 将显著增加 GA 使用量。"

msgid ""
"**``IEXT_T``\\ =\\ *value*, ``REXT_T``\\ =\\ *value*** PAO domain selection "
"criteria similar to ``IEXT`` and ``REXT`` but affect only (T) calculations. "
"Defaults to ``IEXT`` and ``REXT``, respectively."
msgstr ""
"**``IEXT_T``\\ =\\ *\\ value\\ *, ``REXT_T``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 与 ``IEXT`` 和"
" ``REXT`` 类似的 PAO 域选择判据，但仅影响 (T) 计算。默认值分别为 ``IEXT`` 和 ``REXT``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"The selection of the **triple list** is controlled by the following options:"
msgstr "**三激发列表**\\ 的选择由以下选项控制："

msgid ""
"**``TRIPTYP``\\ =\\ *value*** Determines triples list via pair classes "
"(default 2)."
msgstr "**``TRIPTYP``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 通过对儿类别确定三激发列表（默认 2）。"

msgid ""
"**``THRCLOSE_T``\\ =\\ *value*** Energy threshold for close pairs in "
"selecting triples (in :math:`E_h`, default 1.d-4)."
msgstr ""
"**``THRCLOSE_T``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 选择三激发行时近对的能量阈值（单位 :math:`E_h`\\ ，默认 "
"1.d-4）。"

msgid ""
"**``THRWEAK_T``\\ =\\ *value*** Energy threshold for weak pairs in selecting"
" triples (in :math:`E_h`, default 0, i.e., considering all nondistant pairs "
"“close” in the triple selection)."
msgstr ""
"**``THRWEAK_T``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 选择三激发行时弱对的能量阈值（单位 :math:`E_h`\\ ，默认 "
"0，即在三激发选择中将所有非远对视为“近”）。"

msgid ""
"**``THRTRIP``\\ =\\ *value*** Threshold for additional triple screening "
"using (T0) triple corrections from a small-domain calculation (in "
":math:`E_h`, default 0, i.e., perform (T0) calculation for all triples "
"selected by ``TRIPTYP``)."
msgstr ""
"**``THRTRIP``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 使用小域计算的 (T0) 三激发校正进行额外三激发筛选的阈值（单位 "
":math:`E_h`\\ ，默认 0，即对由 ``TRIPTYP`` 选出的所有三激发行执行 (T0) 计算）。"

msgid ""
"**``THRTRIP_IT``\\ =\\ *value*** (T0) energy threshold for screening triples"
" before the iterations (in :math:`E_h`, default 1.d-7)."
msgstr ""
"**``THRTRIP_IT``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 迭代前筛选三激发的 (T0) 能量阈值（单位 :math:`E_h`\\ ，默认"
" 1.d-7）。"

msgid "Options for F12 calculations"
msgstr "F12 计算的选项"

msgid ""
"**``PROJECTOR``\\ =**\\ ``PNO|PAO|MIXED`` (*since 2022.1*, default PNO) The "
"type of virtual orbitals to be used in the F12 strong orthogonality "
"projector. ``MIXED`` means using PAOs in the LMP2-F12 projector and the PNOs"
" in the LCCSD-F12 projector. In typical calculations this does not affect "
"the relative energy significantly. In some difficult cases (e.g., there is "
"correlated core orbitals) the PAO projector may lead to more accurate "
"results. The ``PAO`` option is somewhat more expensive than the other "
"choices."
msgstr ""
"**``PROJECTOR``\\ =**\\ ``PNO|PAO|MIXED``\\ （\\ *自 2022.1 起*\\ ，默认 PNO）F12 "
"强正交投影器中使用的虚轨道类型。\\ ``MIXED`` 表示在 LMP2-F12 投影器中使用 PAO，在 LCCSD-F12 投影器中使用 "
"PNO。在典型计算中，这不会显著影响相对能。在某些困难情况下（例如存在相关芯轨道），PAO 投影器可能得到更精确的结果。\\ ``PAO`` "
"选项的开销比其他选择略大。"

msgid ""
"**``THRF12``\\ =\\ *threshold*** LMP2 pair energy threshold for selecting "
"pairs for which F12 corrections are computed (default 0, i.e., all "
"nondistant pairs are included)."
msgstr ""
"**``THRF12``\\ =\\ *\\ threshold*** 用于选择计算 F12 校正的对儿的 LMP2 对能量阈值（默认 "
"0，即包括所有非远对）。"

msgid ""
"**``THRVAL``\\ =\\ *value*** The MP2 pair energy threshold in determining "
"the LMO domains :math:`[ij]_{\\rm LMO}` used in the F12 strong orthogonality"
" projector (default :math:`10^{-5}`). This option only applies to the "
"selection of the valence occupied orbitals in the LMO domains."
msgstr ""
"**``THRVAL``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 确定 F12 强正交投影器中使用的 LMO 域 :math:`[ij]_{\\rm "
"LMO}` 时的 MP2 对能量阈值（默认 :math:`10^{-5}`\\ ）。此选项仅适用于 LMO 域中价占据轨道的选择。"

msgid ""
"**``ICOREDOM_F12``\\ =\\ *value*, ``RCOREDOM_F12``\\ =\\ *value*** The "
"connectivity and distance (in :math:`a_0`) criteria in determining the LMO "
"domains :math:`[ij]_{\\rm LMO}` used in the F12 strong orthogonality "
"projector (defaults are 2 and 5.0, respectively). This option only applies "
"to the selection of the core orbitals in the LMO domains."
msgstr ""
"**``ICOREDOM_F12``\\ =\\ *\\ value\\ *, ``RCOREDOM_F12``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** "
"确定 F12 强正交投影器中使用的 LMO 域 :math:`[ij]_{\\rm LMO}` 时的连通性和距离（单位 :math:`a_0`\\ "
"）判据（默认值分别为 2 和 5.0）。此选项仅适用于 LMO 域中芯轨道的选择。"

msgid ""
"**``MODOMC``\\ =\\ *value*** (*since Molpro 2020.2*) By default core "
"contributions are included (``MODOMC=0``) in the CCSD-F12 projector. With "
"``MODOMC=1`` these contributions are neglected, which slightly reduces the "
"cost and usually introduces only small errors. However, the approximation "
"can have a significant effect in calculations of transition metal complexes."
" *The approximation is always applied before Molpro 2020.2.*"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``IRIDOM``\\ =\\ *value*** RI domain extension using connectivity. The "
"default is 3."
msgstr "**``IRIDOM``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 使用连通性的 RI 域扩展。默认值为 3。"

msgid ""
"**``RRIDOM``\\ =\\ *value*** RI domain extension using distances in "
":math:`a_0`. The default is 7. If both ``IRIDOM`` and ``RRIDOM`` are given, "
"the RI basis functions at a center will be included when either criterion is"
" fulfilled."
msgstr ""
"**``RRIDOM``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 使用距离（单位 :math:`a_0`\\ ）的 RI 域扩展。默认值为 7。若同时给出"
" ``IRIDOM`` 和 ``RRIDOM``\\ ，则只要满足任一判据，中心处的 RI 基函数就会被包含。"

msgid ""
"**``CCF12``\\ =\\ *[0|1]***. If ccf12=0, the MP2 F12 correction is added to "
"the PNO-LCCSD(T) energy, i.e. no F12 is included in the PNO-LCCSD step "
"(default CCF12=1, i.e. PNO-LCCSD-F12 is done)."
msgstr ""
"**``CCF12``\\ =\\ *\\ [0|1]***。若 ccf12=0，MP2 F12 校正被加到 PNO-LCCSD(T) 能量中，即在 "
"PNO-LCCSD 步骤中不包含 F12（默认 CCF12=1，即执行 PNO-LCCSD-F12）。"

msgid "Options for fitting basis and orbital screening"
msgstr "拟合基组与轨道筛选选项"

msgid ""
"**``IDFDOM``\\ =\\ *value*** Fitting domain extension using connectivity "
"criterion (default 3)."
msgstr "**``IDFDOM``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 使用连通性判据扩展拟合域（默认 3）。"

msgid ""
"**``RDFDOM``\\ =\\ *value*** Fitting domain extension using distances "
"criterion (in :math:`a_0`, default 7). If both ``IDFDOM`` and ``RDFDOM`` are"
" given, the DF functions at a center will be included when either criterion "
"is fulfilled."
msgstr ""
"**``RDFDOM``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 使用距离判据扩展拟合域（单位 :math:`a_0`\\ ，默认 7）。若同时给出 "
"``IDFDOM`` 和 ``RDFDOM``\\ ，则只要满足任一判据，中心处的 DF 函数就会被包含。"

msgid ""
"**``IDFDOM_T``\\ =\\ *value*, ``RDFDOM_T``\\ =\\ *value*** Fitting domain "
"extension criteria similar to ``IDFDOM`` and ``RDFDOM`` but apply only to "
"(T) calculations. The default values are 0 for both, in which case the "
"primary fitting domains are used."
msgstr ""
"**``IDFDOM_T``\\ =\\ *\\ value\\ *, ``RDFDOM_T``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 类似于 "
"``IDFDOM`` 和 ``RDFDOM`` 的拟合域扩展判据，但仅适用于 (T) 计算。两者的默认值均为 0，此时使用主拟合域。"

msgid ""
"**``FITLMO``\\ =\\ *threshold*** In the PNO program LMOs are truncated if "
"the square sum of the coefficients at one center is smaller than *threshold*"
" (default 1.d-6). The remaining LMO coefficients are fitted to the original "
"LMO."
msgstr ""
"**``FITLMO``\\ =\\ *\\ threshold*** 在 PNO 程序中，若某中心处系数的平方和小于 *\\ threshold*，则"
" LMO 被截断（默认 1.d-6）。剩余的 LMO 系数被拟合到原始 LMO。"

msgid ""
"**``FITPAO``\\ =\\ *threshold*** In the PNO program PAOs at one center are "
"truncated when none of the PAOs at the center has a square sum of "
"coefficients greater than *threshold* (default 1.d-6). The remaining PAO "
"coefficients are fitted to the original PAOs."
msgstr ""
"**``FITPAO``\\ =\\ *\\ threshold*** 在 PNO 程序中，若某中心处所有 PAO 的系数平方和均不大于 *\\ "
"threshold*，则该中心处的 PAO 被截断（默认 1.d-6）。剩余的 PAO 系数被拟合到原始 PAO。"

msgid "Options for intermolecular interactions"
msgstr "分子间相互作用选项"

msgid ""
"The following special options for computing intermolecular interactions are "
"available since Molpro2022.3. The purpose is to save computation time by "
"using small (e.g. default) domains for intramolecular pairs, but larger "
"(tight) domains for intermolecular pairs. This is still experimental."
msgstr ""
"自 Molpro2022.3 "
"起，以下用于计算分子间相互作用的特殊选项可用。其目的在于对分子内对使用较小（例如默认）的域、而对分子间对使用较大（紧致）的域，从而节省计算时间。此功能仍属实验性。"

msgid ""
"``INTERACT`` (logical) Activates options for intermolecular interactions. "
"The individual molecules are determined automatically."
msgstr "``INTERACT``\\ （逻辑值）激活分子间相互作用选项。各个分子会被自动确定。"

msgid ""
"**``IEXT_INTMOL``\\ =\\ *value*** PAO connectivity criterion for "
"intermolecular pairs."
msgstr "**``IEXT_INTMOL``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 用于分子间对的 PAO 连通性判据。"

msgid ""
"**``REXT_INTMOL``\\ =\\ *value*** PAO distance criterion for intermolecular "
"pairs."
msgstr "**``REXT_INTMOL``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 用于分子间对的 PAO 距离判据。"

msgid ""
"**``THRPNO_CC_INTMOL``\\ =\\ *value*** PNO occupation number threshold for "
"intermolecular pairs (only for CC domains)."
msgstr "**``THRPNO_CC_INTMOL``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 用于分子间对的 PNO 占据数阈值（仅用于 CC 域）。"

msgid ""
"**``THREN_CC_INTMOL``\\ =\\ *value*** Energy completeness criterion for "
"intermolecular pairs (only for CC domains)."
msgstr "**``THREN_CC_INTMOL``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 用于分子间对的能量完备性判据（仅用于 CC 域）。"

msgid ""
"**``THRTNO_T0_INTMOL``\\ =\\ *value*** Threshold for selecting T0 domains "
"for intermolecular triples."
msgstr "**``THRTNO_T0_INTMOL``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 为分子间三重组选择 T0 域的阈值。"

msgid ""
"**``THRTNO_T_INTMOL``\\ =\\ *value*** Threshold for selecting T domains for "
"intermolecular triples."
msgstr "**``THRTNO_T_INTMOL``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 为分子间三重组选择 T 域的阈值。"

msgid ""
"**``TYPE_INTMOL``\\ =\\ *value*** Type for intermolecular pairs "
"(STRONG\\|CLOSE\\|WEAK)"
msgstr "**``TYPE_INTMOL``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 分子间对的类型（STRONG\\|CLOSE\\|WEAK）"

msgid ""
"**``TYPE_INTMOL_T``\\ =\\ *value*** Type for intermolecular triples "
"(STRONG\\|CLOSE\\|WEAK). With WEAK, intermolecular triples are excluded."
msgstr ""
"**``TYPE_INTMOL_T``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 分子间三重组类型（STRONG\\|CLOSE\\|WEAK）。使用 "
"WEAK 时排除分子间三重组。"

msgid ""
"Additional domain selection options ``DEFAULT+`` and ``TIGHT+`` are "
"provided. ``DEFAULT+`` differs from DEFAULT by increasing **REXT=5** to "
"**REXT=7**. ``TIGHT+`` differs from TIGHT by increasing **THREN_CC** from "
"**0.990 to 0.997**. For highly accurate calculations of interaction energies"
" we recommend the options ``DOMOPT=TIGHT, DOMOPT_INTMOL=TIGHT+``. Nearly as "
"accurate but less expensive are options ``DOMOPT=DEFAULT+, "
"DOMOPT_INTMOL=TIGHT+``. See `Phys. Chem. A 129, 4812 (2025) "
"<https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpca.5c02316>`__ for benchmarks."
msgstr ""
"还提供了附加的域选择选项 ``DEFAULT+`` 和 ``TIGHT+``\\ 。\\ ``DEFAULT+`` 与 DEFAULT 的区别在于将 "
"**REXT=5** 增至 **REXT=7**\\ 。\\ ``TIGHT+`` 与 TIGHT 的区别在于将 **THREN_CC** 从 "
"**0.990 增至 0.997**\\ 。对于高精度的相互作用能计算，我们推荐使用选项 ``DOMOPT=TIGHT, "
"DOMOPT_INTMOL=TIGHT+``\\ 。精度几乎相当但开销更低的选项是 ``DOMOPT=DEFAULT+, "
"DOMOPT_INTMOL=TIGHT+``\\ 。基准测试参见 `Phys. Chem. A 129, 4812 (2025) "
"<https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpca.5c02316>`__\\ 。"

msgid "Miscellaneous options"
msgstr "其他选项"

msgid "**``MAXIT``\\ =\\ *value*** The maximum number of PNO-LCCSD iterations."
msgstr "**``MAXIT``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** PNO-LCCSD 迭代的最大次数。"

msgid ""
"**``MAXIT_LMP2``\\ =\\ *value*** The maximum number of PNO-LMP2 iterations."
msgstr "**``MAXIT_LMP2``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** PNO-LMP2 迭代的最大次数。"

msgid "**``MAXITT``\\ =\\ *value*** The maximum number of (T) iterations."
msgstr "**``MAXITT``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** (T) 迭代的最大次数。"

msgid ""
"**``THRCONV_TRIP``\\ =\\ *value*** Convergence threshold (energy) for (T) "
"iterations."
msgstr "**``THRCONV_TRIP``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** (T) 迭代的收敛阈值（能量）。"

msgid ""
"Note that the local MP2 and (T) equations are linear and usually converge in"
" several iterations. Difficulties in convergence is usually caused by poor "
"orbital localization."
msgstr "注意，局域 MP2 与 (T) 方程为线性方程，通常在若干次迭代后即可收敛。收敛困难通常由轨道定域化不良引起。"

msgid "Restarting (T)"
msgstr "重启 (T)"

msgid ""
"The (T) calculations in PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 can be restarted from a dump file "
"since Molpro 2022.3. The options to create a dump file and restart from it "
"are:"
msgstr ""
"自 Molpro 2022.3 起，PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 中的 (T) 计算可从转储文件重启。创建转储文件及从该文件重启的选项如下："

msgid ""
"**``CCSDDUMP``\\ =\\ *path*** The dump file to be created. It can be a "
"absolute path or a relative path to the input file. Quote the path with "
"single quotation marks to avoid case conversion. The dump file is created at"
" the beginning of the (T) calculation."
msgstr ""
"**``CCSDDUMP``\\ =\\ *\\ path*** "
"要创建的转储文件。它可以是绝对路径，也可以是相对于输入文件的相对路径。请用单引号括起路径以避免大小写转换。该转储文件在 (T) 计算开始时创建。"

msgid ""
"**``RESTART_T``\\ =\\ *path*** The dump file from which (T) is restarted. If"
" given, the program will start from the (T) calculation directly from the "
"dump file."
msgstr "**``RESTART_T``\\ =\\ *\\ path*** 用于重启 (T) 的转储文件。若给出，程序将直接从该转储文件开始 (T) 计算。"

msgid ""
"In trail calculations where the memory requirement is unknown, when (T) "
"calculation crashes due to insufficient memory, the calculation can be "
"restarted from the dump file if it is requested. These options can also be "
"used in testing different local options that only affects the (T) "
"calculation."
msgstr ""
"在内存需求未知的试算中，当 (T) 计算因内存不足而崩溃时，若已请求，则可以从转储文件重启计算。这些选项也可用于测试仅影响 (T) 计算的不同局域选项。"

msgid ""
"The dump file is an HDF5 file. If Molpro is compiled from the source code, "
"``--with-hdf5`` must be given to ``configure`` to use this feature."
msgstr ""
"该 dump 文件是 HDF5 文件。如果 Molpro 从源代码编译，则必须在 ``configure`` 时提供 ``--with-hdf5`` "
"才能使用此功能。"

msgid "Correlation regions in the PNO program [REGION]"
msgstr "PNO 程序中的相关区域 [REGION]"

msgid ""
"Correlation regions can be defined using ``REGION`` directives within the "
"PNO program. This is a 2-step process: first, LMOs are assigned to a region "
"(HF, LOW, or HIGH]. Then, orbital pairs :math:`i,j` are selected for that "
"region depending if :math:`i` or :math:`j` or both are in the corresponding "
"orbital region. Similarly, in PNO-LCCSD(T) or PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 calculations "
"only those triples :math:`i,j,k` are include for which either 1, 2, or 3 of "
"the three orbitals are in the region (this applies only to the high-level "
"region)."
msgstr ""
"相关区域可以在 PNO 程序中使用 ``REGION`` 指令定义。这是一个两步过程：首先，将 LMO 分配给一个区域（HF、LOW 或 "
"HIGH）。然后，根据 :math:`i` 或 :math:`j` 或两者是否在相应的轨道区域中，为该区域选择轨道对 :math:`i,j`\\ "
"。类似地，在 PNO-LCCSD(T) 或 PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 计算中，只包含那些三个轨道中有 1、2 或 3 个在区域内的三重态 "
":math:`i,j,k`\\ （这仅适用于高等级区域）。"

msgid "where"
msgstr "其中"

msgid "\\* ``LOC_METHOD = LOW|MP2`` for the low-level method (LMP2 or LMP2-F12)"
msgstr "\\* ``LOC_METHOD = LOW|MP2`` 用于低等级方法（LMP2 或 LMP2-F12）"

msgid ""
"\\* ``LOC_METHOD = HIGH|CCSD`` for the current high-level method [e.g. "
"LCCSD(T) or LCCSD(T)-F12]"
msgstr "\\* ``LOC_METHOD = HIGH|CCSD`` 用于当前高等级方法 [例如 LCCSD(T) 或 LCCSD(T)-F12]"

msgid ""
"LMOs that are not included in the HIGH- or LOW-level regions are assigned to"
" the HF region. These orbitals are not correlated at all."
msgstr "未包含在 HIGH 或 LOW 等级区域中的 LMO 被分配给 HF 区域。这些轨道完全不相关。"

msgid ""
"\\* ``INCLUSIVE`` (default) means that orbitals are selected which contain "
"in their primary domain at least one of the chosen atoms."
msgstr "\\* ``INCLUSIVE``\\ （默认）意味着选择其主域中至少包含一个所选原子的轨道。"

msgid ""
"\\* ``EXCLUSIVE``  means that orbitals are selected which contain in the "
"primary domain only atoms only chosen atoms."
msgstr "\\* ``EXCLUSIVE`` 意味着选择其主域中仅包含所选原子的轨道。"

msgid ""
"\\* ``RESTRICT_P=1|2``  RESTRICT_P=1 (default) means that an orbital pair "
":math:`i,j` is included in this correlation region if either :math:`i` or "
":math:`j` is in the orbital region. RESTRICT_P=2 means that an orbital pair "
":math:`i,j` is included if both orbitals are in the orbital region. Other "
"pairs are assigned to the next lower region (in the order HIGH, LOW, HF)."
msgstr ""
"\\* ``RESTRICT_P=1|2``  RESTRICT_P=1（默认）意味着如果 :math:`i` 或 :math:`j` "
"在轨道区域中，则轨道对 :math:`i,j` 被包含在此相关区域中。RESTRICT_P=2 意味着如果两个轨道都在轨道区域中，则包含轨道对 "
":math:`i,j`\\ 。其他对分配给下一个较低区域（按 HIGH、LOW、HF 的顺序）。"

msgid ""
"\\* ``RESTRICT_T=1|2|3``  (default 2 means that a triple :math:`i,j,k`  is "
"included in the region of one, two or three orbitals of the triple are in "
"the region. This only applies to the high-level region."
msgstr ""
"\\* ``RESTRICT_T=1|2|3`` （默认 2 意味着如果三重态 :math:`i,j,k` "
"中的一个、两个或三个轨道在区域中，则该三重态被包含在区域中。这仅适用于高等级区域。"

msgid ""
"\\* ``CENTERS=[//list//]`` A list of atoms that are assigned to the current "
"region. Positive numbers refer to the respective row in the input z-matrix. "
"Negative numbers mean \"up to\" this atom, starting with the previous "
"number. Example: CENTERS=[5,-10, 12] means centers five to ten and 12. In "
"order to keep this input short and simple, it is advisable to order the "
"centers in the xyz input according to regions."
msgstr ""
"\\* ``CENTERS=[//list//]`` 分配给当前区域的原子列表。正数指输入 z-matrix "
"中的相应行。负数表示“直到”该原子，从前一个数字开始。示例：CENTERS=[5,-10, 12] 表示中心五到十和 12。为了保持输入简短简单，建议在"
" xyz 输入中按区域对中心进行排序。"

msgid ""
"\\* ``REXT_REG=//value//`` The given list of centers is augmented by all "
"centers within REXT_REG bohr from any atom in the initial list."
msgstr "\\* ``REXT_REG=//value//`` 给定的中心列表通过初始列表中任何原子在 REXT_REG 玻尔范围内的所有中心进行扩充。"

msgid ""
"\\* ``IEXT_REG=//value//`` The given list of centers is augmented by all "
"centers within IEXT_REG bonds from any atom in the initial list."
msgstr "\\* ``IEXT_REG=//value//`` 给定的中心列表通过初始列表中任何原子在 IEXT_REG 键范围内的所有中心进行扩充。"

msgid ""
"Example for C\\ :math:`_4`\\ H\\ :math:`_9`\\ COOH, where the order is CH3 -"
" CH2 - CH2 - CH2 - COOH:"
msgstr ""
"C\\ :math:`_4`\\ H\\ :math:`_9`\\ COOH 的示例，其中顺序为 CH3 - CH2 - CH2 - CH2 - "
"COOH："

msgid "{pno-lccsd(t)-f12"
msgstr "{pno-lccsd(t)-f12"

msgid ""
"In this case atoms 14-17 are the COOH group. The orbitals of COOH group and "
"in addition the connected C-C bond orbital are assigned to the high level "
"region. The C-H orbitals or the CH3  group are in the HF region and not "
"correlated."
msgstr ""
"在这种情况下，原子 14-17 是 COOH 基团。COOH 基团的轨道以及连接的 C-C 键轨道被分配给高等级区域。C-H 轨道或 CH3 基团在 "
"HF 区域中且不相关。"

msgid ""
"It is also possible to specify region-specific domain options. The following"
" options can be given on a region directive:"
msgstr "还可以指定区域特定的域选项。可以在区域指令上给出以下选项："

msgid ""
"``DOMOPT, THRPNO_LMP2, THRPNO_CC, THREN_LMP2, THREN_CC, IEXTDOM, IEXTDOM_S, "
"REXTDOM, REXTDOM_S``"
msgstr ""
"``DOMOPT, THRPNO_LMP2, THRPNO_CC, THREN_LMP2, THREN_CC, IEXTDOM, IEXTDOM_S, "
"REXTDOM, REXTDOM_S``"

msgid "Their meaning is the same as described for the PNO program."
msgstr "它们的含义与 PNO 程序中描述的含义相同。"

msgid "Advanced options"
msgstr "高级选项"

msgid ""
"In this section we list some advanced options to the PNO program. These "
"options exist for technical or historical reasons and we do not recommend "
"modifying the default values in general."
msgstr "在本节中，我们列出 PNO 程序的一些高级选项。这些选项因技术或历史原因而存在，我们通常不建议修改默认值。"

msgid "The following options are available for the **orbital localization**:"
msgstr "以下选项可用于\\ **轨道定域化**\\ ："

msgid ""
"**``LOC_METHOD``\\ =\\ *method*** Localization method. *method* can be "
"``IBO`` (intrinsic bond orbitals, default), ``PM`` (Pipek-Mezey), ``BOYS`` "
"(Forster-Boys localization). ``IBO`` is recommended, as it is most efficient"
" and stable."
msgstr ""
"**``LOC_METHOD``\\ =\\ *\\ method*** 定域化方法。*\\ method* 可以是 ``IBO``\\ "
"（内在键轨道，默认）、\\ ``PM``\\ （Pipek-Mezey）、\\ ``BOYS``\\ （Forster-Boys 定域化）。推荐使用 "
"``IBO``\\ ，因为它最高效且稳定。"

msgid ""
"**``LOC_METHOD_CORE``\\ =\\ *method*** Localization method for core "
"orbitals. *method* can be ``IBO``, ``PM``, ``IBO(AO)``, or ``PM(AO)``. The "
"latter two minimize mixings of core orbitals of different types (e.g. s, p\\"
" :math:`_y`, p\\ :math:`_x`, p\\ :math:`_z` etc.). The default is "
"``IBO(AO)``."
msgstr ""
"**``LOC_METHOD_CORE``\\ =\\ *\\ method*** 芯轨道的定域化方法。*\\ method* 可以是 "
"``IBO``\\ 、\\ ``PM``\\ 、\\ ``IBO(AO)`` 或 ``PM(AO)``\\ 。后两者最小化不同类型芯轨道（例如 "
"s、p\\ :math:`_y`\\ 、p\\ :math:`_x`\\ 、p\\ :math:`_z` 等）的混合。默认值为 "
"``IBO(AO)``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``IBTYPE``\\ =\\ *value*** Projector type for generation of intrinsic "
"atomic orbitals. *value* can be 1 or 2 (default)."
msgstr "**``IBTYPE``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 用于生成内在原子轨道的投影仪类型。*\\ value* 可以是 1 或 2（默认）。"

msgid ""
"**``IBOEXP``\\ =\\ *value*** Exponent used in the PM-like localization "
"functional. *value* can be 2 or 4 (default)."
msgstr "**``IBOEXP``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 用于类 PM 定域化泛函的指数。*\\ value* 可以是 2 或 4（默认）。"

msgid ""
"``LOC_OUTCORE=ON|OFF|SEP|MIX`` If (outer) core orbitals are correlated, this"
" option determines how these are localised. ``ON`` or ``MIX``: localization "
"together with the valence orbitals; ``OFF``: no localization; ``SEP``: "
"localisation separately from the valence orbitals, i.e. in a different "
"localization group. With ``OFF`` and ``SEP``, the orbitals are sorted before"
" localization, so that the correlated core orbital come before the valence "
"orbitals. WITH ``ON`` and ``MIX`` all correlated orbitals are first "
"localized and then sorted. WITH ``MIX`` the outer core orbitals are "
"subsequently re-localized using IBO(AO). This sometimes reduces the mixing "
"of (nearly) degenerate atomic core orbitals. The default is ``SEP``."
msgstr ""
"``LOC_OUTCORE=ON|OFF|SEP|MIX`` 如果（外层）芯轨道相关，此选项决定它们如何定域化。\\ ``ON`` 或 "
"``MIX``\\ ：与价层轨道一起定域化；\\ ``OFF``\\ ：不定域化；\\ ``SEP``\\ "
"：与价层轨道分开定域化，即在不同的定域化组中。使用 ``OFF`` 和 ``SEP`` 时，轨道在定域化之前排序，以便相关的芯轨道在价层轨道之前。使用 "
"``ON`` 和 ``MIX`` 时，所有相关轨道首先定域化然后排序。使用 ``MIX`` 时，外层芯轨道随后使用 IBO(AO) "
"重新定域化。这有时会减少（几乎）简并的原子芯轨道的混合。默认值为 ``SEP``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``SAVE_LMO``\\ =\\ *value*** If this option is given, the localised "
"orbitals are written to a record. If ***value=1*** the current orbital dump "
"record is used. If ***value>1000*** the given record is used (e.g. "
"***value=2110.2***). Furthermore, the orbitals are written to the xml file "
"(if present) for visualisation with gmolpro."
msgstr ""
"**``SAVE_LMO``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 如果给出此选项，定域化轨道被写入一个记录。如果 ***value=1*** "
"则使用当前轨道 dump 记录。如果 ***value>1000*** 则使用给定的记录（例如 ***value=2110.2***）。此外，轨道被写入"
" xml 文件（如果存在）以便使用 gmolpro 进行可视化。"

msgid "Options for **PAO domain selection**:"
msgstr "**PAO 域选择**\\ 的选项："

msgid ""
"**``THRBP``\\ =\\ *value*** Boughton-Pulay (BP) completeness criterion for "
"selection of primary PAO domains (default 0, i.e., do not use the BP "
"procedure). The BP criterion takes precedence over the LMO partial charge "
"criterion if a positive ``THRBP`` is given."
msgstr ""
"**``THRBP``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 用于选择主 PAO 域的 Boughton-Pulay (BP) 完备性判据（默认 "
"0，即不使用 BP 过程）。若给定正的 ``THRBP``\\ ，则 BP 判据优先于 LMO 部分电荷判据。"

msgid ""
"**``THRLOC``\\ =\\ *value*** Redundancy threshold in the PAO pair domain "
"generation. Default :math:`10^{-7}`."
msgstr "**``THRLOC``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** PAO 对域生成中的冗余阈值。默认 :math:`10^{-7}`\\ 。"

msgid "Options for **OSV generation**:"
msgstr "**OSV 生成**\\ 的选项："

msgid ""
"``OSV_AMPL=PAO|CAN|OPT`` Amplitudes to used to generate OSVs. ``PAO`` "
"(default) means to use semi-canonical amplitudes in the PAO domains; ``CAN``"
" means semi-canonical in the full virtual space; ``OPT`` means fully "
"optimized LMP2 amplitudes in the full virtual space."
msgstr ""
"``OSV_AMPL=PAO|CAN|OPT`` 用于生成 OSV 的振幅。\\ ``PAO``\\ （默认）表示在 PAO 域中使用半正则振幅；\\ "
"``CAN`` 表示在完整虚空间中使用半正则振幅；\\ ``OPT`` 表示在完整虚空间中使用完全优化的 LMP2 振幅。"

msgid ""
"**``THRLOC``\\ =\\ *value*** Redundancy threshold in the OSV  pair domain "
"generation. Default :math:`10^{-6}`."
msgstr "**``THRLOC``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** OSV 对域生成中的冗余阈值。默认 :math:`10^{-6}`\\ 。"

msgid "Options for **multipole approximations**:"
msgstr "**多极近似**\\ 的选项："

msgid ""
"**``MLTP_METHOD``\\ =\\ *value*** If 1 use non-iterative multipole "
"approximation for distant pairs, if 2 iterative multipole approximation "
"(default 2)."
msgstr "**``MLTP_METHOD``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 若为 1，对远对使用非迭代多极近似；若为 2，使用迭代多极近似（默认 2）。"

msgid ""
"**``MLTP_ORDER``\\ =\\ *value*** Expansion level for multipole approximation"
" (default 3)."
msgstr "**``MLTP_ORDER``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 多极近似的展开阶数（默认 3）。"

msgid ""
"**``MLTP_SELECT``\\ =\\ *value*** Expansion level of multipole approximation"
" used to select distant pairs (default MLTP_ORDER)."
msgstr "**``MLTP_SELECT``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 用于选择远对的多极近似展开阶数（默认 MLTP_ORDER）。"

msgid "Options for **PNO generation**:"
msgstr "**PNO 生成**\\ 的选项："

msgid ""
"``PNO_AMPL=PAO|PAO(OPT)|OSV|OSV(OPT)`` Amplitudes to used to generate PNOs. "
"``PAO`` (default) means semi-canonical (non-iterative) PAO amplitudes, and "
"``OSV`` means to use semi-canonical (non-iterative) OSV amplitudes. ``OSV`` "
"is not supported in open-shell calculations. If ``(OPT)`` is appended the "
"amplitudes are iteratively optimized (can be expensive with ``OSV(OPT)`` and"
" very expensive with ``PAO(OPT)``!"
msgstr ""
"``PNO_AMPL=PAO|PAO(OPT)|OSV|OSV(OPT)`` 用于生成 PNO 的振幅。\\ ``PAO``\\ "
"（默认）表示半正则（非迭代）PAO 振幅，\\ ``OSV`` 表示使用半正则（非迭代）OSV 振幅。开壳层计算中不支持 ``OSV``\\ 。若附加 "
"``(OPT)``\\ ，则振幅进行迭代优化（使用 ``OSV(OPT)`` 时可能开销较大，使用 ``PAO(OPT)`` 时开销非常大！"

msgid ""
"``THRDEG`` (*Since Molpro 2020.1*) PNOs with occupation number difference "
"less than ``THRDEG`` (default :math:`10^{-12}`) are considered degenerate. "
"Degenerate PNOs are either all included or all excluded from the domains."
msgstr ""
"``THRDEG``\\ （\\ *自 Molpro 2020.1 起*\\ ）占据数差异小于 ``THRDEG``\\ （默认 "
":math:`10^{-12}`\\ ）的 PNO 被视为简并。简并 PNO 要么全部纳入域，要么全部排除出域。"

msgid ""
"``PNO_DIAG`` (logical). If true, use PNO domain selection criterion also for"
" diagonal pairs. Otherwise OSV domains are used for diagonal pairs. If "
"``PNO_DIAG=true`` the threshold ``THROSV`` only affects the distant pair "
"multipole treatment."
msgstr ""
"``PNO_DIAG``\\ （逻辑值）。若为真，则对角对也使用 PNO 域选择判据。否则对角对使用 OSV 域。若 "
"``PNO_DIAG=true``\\ ，阈值 ``THROSV`` 仅影响远对多极处理。"

msgid ""
"The PNO program divides basis functions to blocks for integral screening. "
"The following options are available for defining the **block sizes**. A "
"smaller block size encourages more efficient integral screening, reduces "
"scratch memory usage, and improves the parallel efficiency. However, a "
"larger block size improves the performance of matrix operations, and reduces"
" the communication and bookkeeping cost."
msgstr ""
"PNO 程序将基函数划分为块以进行积分筛选。以下选项可用于定义\\ **块大小**\\ "
"。较小的块大小有利于更高效的积分筛选，减少临时内存使用，并提高并行效率。然而，较大的块大小可提升矩阵运算性能，并减少通信和簿记开销。"

msgid ""
"**``BB_BLOCKS_AO``\\ =\\ *value*** Target blocking size in the AO basis "
"(default 32)."
msgstr "**``BB_BLOCKS_AO``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** AO 基中的目标分块大小（默认 32）。"

msgid ""
"**``BB_BLOCKS_DF_F12``\\ =\\ *value*** Target blocking size in the DF basis "
"for the F12 calculations (default 32). The option does not affect PNO-LMP2 "
"calculations."
msgstr ""
"**``BB_BLOCKS_DF_F12``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** F12 计算中 DF 基的目标分块大小（默认 32）。该选项不影响 "
"PNO-LMP2 计算。"

msgid ""
"**``BB_BLOCKS_RI``\\ =\\ *value*** Target blocking size in the RI basis for "
"the F12 calculations (default 128)."
msgstr "**``BB_BLOCKS_RI``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** F12 计算中 RI 基的目标分块大小（默认 128）。"

msgid ""
"In addition, the following options control the **integral screening "
"thresholds**:"
msgstr "此外，以下选项控制\\ **积分筛选阈值**\\ ："

msgid "**``BB_THRESH``\\ =\\ *value*** Block screening threshold (default 1.d-5)."
msgstr "**``BB_THRESH``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 块筛选阈值（默认 1.d-5）。"

msgid "**``BB_RADIUS``\\ =\\ *value*** Block screening radius (default 4)."
msgstr "**``BB_RADIUS``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 块筛选半径（默认 4）。"

msgid "Other miscellaneous options:"
msgstr "其他杂项选项："

msgid ""
"**``BB_F12_PNO``\\ =\\ *value*** (deprecated since Molpro 2022.2, use "
"``PROJECTOR`` instead) If ``BB_F12_PNO``\\ =0, PNO-LMP2-F12 energies with "
"both OSV and PNO projectors will be computed; If ``BB_F12_PNO``\\ =1, only "
"energies using the PNO projector will be computed; If ``BB_F12_PNO``\\ =2, "
"only energies with the OSV projector will be computed (default 1). PNO "
"projectors are always used in the F12 terms in coupled-cluster equations "
"regardless of this option."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"``BB_F12_LOCCORE`` (logical) If true (default), localize the core orbitals. "
"This may affect the pair approximations in the LMP2-F12 projector."
msgstr "``BB_F12_LOCCORE``\\ （逻辑值）。若为真（默认），则局域化芯轨道。这可能影响 LMP2-F12 投影子中的对近似。"

msgid "Obsolete options"
msgstr "过时选项"

msgid ""
"The following options that have been deprecated in Molpro 2020.1. They can "
"still be used in calculations with ``version=2019.2``."
msgstr "以下选项在 Molpro 2020.1 中已弃用。它们仍可用于 ``version=2019.2`` 的计算中。"

msgid "``PROJOPT=TIGHT`` Use tight projection approximations."
msgstr "``PROJOPT=TIGHT`` 使用紧投影近似。"

msgid ""
"``ALLTIGHT`` (logical). Use tight domain, pair, and projection "
"approximations."
msgstr "``ALLTIGHT``\\ （逻辑值）。使用紧域、对和投影近似。"

msgid ""
"**Projection approximations** (affected by ``PROJOPT``)((Our benchmark "
"calculations show that the projection approximations are unlikely to be a "
"major contributor to the local errors. These options will be deprecated in a"
" future release.))"
msgstr ""
"**投影近似**\\ （受 ``PROJOPT`` 影响）（（我们的基准计算表明，投影近似不太可能是局域误差的主要来源。这些选项将在未来版本中弃用。））"

msgid "Project K-integrals"
msgstr "投影 K 积分"

msgid "``PROJECT_K``"
msgstr "``PROJECT_K``"

msgid "true"
msgstr "true"

msgid "Project J-integrals"
msgstr "投影 J 积分"

msgid "``PROJECT_J``"
msgstr "``PROJECT_J``"

msgid "all"
msgstr "all"

msgid "weak"
msgstr "weak"

msgid "Projection of singles amplitudes to doubles domains"
msgstr "将单激发振幅投影到双激发域"

msgid "``PROJECT_S``"
msgstr "``PROJECT_S``"

msgid "Projection of 3-external :math:`{\\bf J}({\\bf E}^{kj})` terms"
msgstr "三外项 :math:`{\\bf J}({\\bf E}^{kj})` 的投影"

msgid "``PROJECT_JE``"
msgstr "``PROJECT_JE``"

msgid "on"
msgstr "三外项 :math:`{\\bf K}({\\bf E}^{kj})` 中的投影级别"

msgid "``PROJECT_KE``"
msgstr "``PROJECT_KE``"

msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

msgid ""
"``LOCFIT=0`` Disables local fitting (default is ``LOCFIT=1``). Note that "
"this is extremely expensive and memory demanding for large molecules, and "
"local fitting is seldom a noticeable source of error. *Please use a large "
"``RDFDOM`` instead.*"
msgstr ""
"``LOCFIT=0`` 禁用局域拟合（默认为 ``LOCFIT=1``\\ "
"）。请注意，对于大分子而言这极其昂贵且对内存要求很高，而局域拟合很少成为明显的误差来源。\\ *请改用较大的 ``RDFDOM``。*"

msgid ""
"``LOCRI=0`` Disables local RI (default is ``LOCRI=1``). *Please use a large "
"``RRIDOM`` instead.*"
msgstr "``LOCRI=0`` 禁用局域 RI（默认为 ``LOCRI=1``\\ ）。\\ *请改用较大的 ``RRIDOM``。*"

msgid "Variables set by the PNO program"
msgstr "由 PNO 程序设置的变量"

msgid "``ENERGR`` Reference energy (including CABS correction if present)."
msgstr "``ENERGR`` 参考能量（如存在则包含 CABS 校正）。"

msgid ""
"``ENERGY`` Last computed total energy including the Hartree–Fock energy and "
"CABS correction (if present). In F12 calculations the F12b energy is stored "
"unless the input specifies F12a (*note the different behavior in canonical "
"F12 programs*)."
msgstr ""
"``ENERGY`` 最后计算的总能量，包含 Hartree–Fock 能量和 CABS 校正（如存在）。在 F12 计算中存储的是 F12b "
"能量，除非输入指定了 F12a（\\ *注意规范 F12 程序中的不同行为*\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``ENERGYA`` Total energy using the F12a approximation. Not available in "
"non-F12 calculations."
msgstr "``ENERGYA`` 使用 F12a 近似的总能量。在非 F12 计算中不可用。"

msgid ""
"``ENERGYB`` Total energy using the F12b approximation. Not available in F12a"
" calculations."
msgstr "``ENERGYB`` 使用 F12b 近似的总能量。在 F12a 计算中不可用。"

msgid "``ENERGT0`` (T0) energy contribution."
msgstr "``ENERGT0`` (T0) 能量贡献。"

msgid ""
"``ENERGT1`` (T1) energy contribution. Available only in (T1) calculations, "
"or in iterative (T) calculations with ``skip_t1=0``."
msgstr "``ENERGT1`` (T1) 能量贡献。仅在 (T1) 计算中可用，或在 ``skip_t1=0`` 的迭代 (T) 计算中可用。"

msgid ""
"``ENERGT1`` (T) energy contribution. Contains the scaled triples if "
"``scale_trip=1`` is given."
msgstr "``ENERGT1`` (T) 能量贡献。若给定 ``scale_trip=1``\\ ，则包含标度化的三重激发。"

msgid ""
"``ENERGC`` Total PNO-LCCSD or PNO-LCCSD(T) energy without (T) correction."
msgstr "``ENERGC`` 不含 (T) 校正的 PNO-LCCSD 或 PNO-LCCSD(T) 总能量。"

msgid "``EMP2`` PNO-LMP2 energy without domain correction."
msgstr "``EMP2`` 不含域校正的 PNO-LMP2 能量。"

msgid "``EMP2_DC`` PNO-LMP2 energy including domain correction."
msgstr "``EMP2_DC`` 含域校正的 PNO-LMP2 能量。"

msgid ""
"``EF12`` F12 contribution in PNO-LMP2-F12 (only set in F12 calculations)."
msgstr "``EF12`` PNO-LMP2-F12 中的 F12 贡献（仅在 F12 计算中设置）。"

msgid "``EMP2_F12`` PNO-LMP2-F12 energy (only set in F12 calculations)."
msgstr "``EMP2_F12`` PNO-LMP2-F12 能量（仅在 F12 计算中设置）。"

msgid "``EMP2_PNO`` Same as ``EMP2``."
msgstr "``EMP2_PNO`` 与 ``EMP2`` 相同。"

msgid "``EF12_PNO`` Same as ``EF12``."
msgstr "``EF12_PNO`` 与 ``EF12`` 相同。"

msgid "``EMP2_SCS`` PNO-SCS-LMP2 energy without domain correction."
msgstr "``EMP2_SCS`` 不含域校正的 PNO-SCS-LMP2 能量。"

msgid "``EF12_SCS`` SCS-F12 contribution (only set in F12 calculations)."
msgstr "``EF12_SCS`` SCS-F12 贡献（仅在 F12 计算中设置）。"

msgid ""
"``EMP2_F12_SCS`` PNO-SCS-LMP2-F12 energy (only set in F12 calculations)"
msgstr "``EMP2_F12_SCS`` PNO-SCS-LMP2-F12 能量（仅在 F12 计算中设置）"

msgid ""
"``DOMCORR`` Domain contribution for PNO-LMP2 (should not be added to F12 "
"energies)"
msgstr "``DOMCORR`` PNO-LMP2 的域贡献（不应加到 F12 能量中）"

msgid "``DOMCORR_CC`` PNO-LMP2 domain correction for PNO-LCCSD."
msgstr "``DOMCORR_CC`` 用于 PNO-LCCSD 的 PNO-LMP2 域校正。"

msgid "``DOMCORR_F12`` PNO-LMP2-F12 domain correction for PNO-LCCSD-F12"
msgstr "``DOMCORR_F12`` 用于 PNO-LCCSD-F12 的 PNO-LMP2-F12 域校正"

msgid "``DOMCORR_PNO`` Same as ``DOMCORR``."
msgstr "``DOMCORR_PNO`` 与 ``DOMCORR`` 相同。"

msgid ""
"``ENERGT`` (T) energy contribution in PNO-LCCSD(T) and PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 "
"calculations"
msgstr "``ENERGT`` PNO-LCCSD(T) 和 PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 计算中的 (T) 能量贡献"

msgid ""
"Note: The CABS correction has to be computed beforehand and is stored in "
"variable ``EF12_RHFRELAX``. If this is present, it is in F12 calculations "
"added to all total energies, including the PNO-LMP2 one. It is not added in "
"non-F12 calculations, even if ``EF12_RHFRELAX`` is set."
msgstr ""
"注意：CABS 校正必须预先计算，并存储在变量 ``EF12_RHFRELAX`` 中。若该变量存在，则在 F12 计算中它会被加到所有总能量上，包括 "
"PNO-LMP2 的总能量。在非 F12 计算中不会加上它，即使设置了 ``EF12_RHFRELAX``\\ 。"

msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

msgid "Problems running DF-HF or DF-MP2-F12 on multiple nodes"
msgstr "在多节点上运行 DF-HF 或 DF-MP2-F12 的问题"

msgid ""
"The ``DF-HF`` and ``DF-MP2-F12`` programs are not designed for execution "
"over multiple computer nodes, and all disk I/O are replaced by GA operations"
" in this case. It is sometimes helpful running these calculations separately"
" on one node. For example, one can run a single-node calculation for DF-HF "
"and CABS singles correction with"
msgstr ""
"``DF-HF`` 和 ``DF-MP2-F12`` 程序并非为跨多个计算机节点执行而设计，在这种情况下所有磁盘 I/O 都被 GA "
"操作替代。有时在单个节点上分别运行这些计算会有帮助。例如，可以先在单节点上运行 DF-HF 和 CABS 单激发修正计算，使用"

msgid ""
"and then a PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 calculation can be performed on multiple nodes "
"with"
msgstr "然后可以在多节点上使用以下命令执行 PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 计算"

msgid ""
"The CABS singles corrections must be manually added to the final PNO-"
"LCCSD(T)-F12 results when this procedure is used. Also note that the wave "
"function repository of Molpro needs to be on a network file system "
"accessible to all nodes."
msgstr ""
"使用此流程时，必须手动将 CABS 单激发修正加到最终的 PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 结果中。另请注意，Molpro "
"的波函数库需要位于所有节点均可访问的网络文件系统上。"

msgid "Problems with allocation of GA memory"
msgstr "GA 内存分配问题"

msgid ""
"If the program crashes with a message ”ARMCI DASSERT fail” most likely more "
"GA memory must be specified using the -G command line option, see section "
"`getting started "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#getting-"
"started>`__. This is necessary due to a bug in the GA software, which is out"
" of our control. The GA developers recommend to install the GA software with"
" configure option ``–with-mpi-pr``. This avoids the problem and does not "
"require the -G option. Unfortunately also this GA version, which is MPI "
"based, is not stable on all systems, in particular for large cases. It is "
"also somewhat slower since an extra process is needed. Since molpro 2025.2 "
"``–with-mpi-pr`` is used by default in the Molpro binary."
msgstr ""
"如果程序因消息 ”ARMCI DASSERT fail” 而崩溃，最可能是需要通过 -G 命令行选项指定更多 GA 内存，参见 `getting "
"started "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#getting-"
"started>`__ 一节。这是由于 GA 软件中的一个缺陷所致，我们无法控制。GA 开发者建议使用配置选项 ``–with-mpi-pr`` 安装 "
"GA 软件。这样可以避免该问题，且不需要 -G 选项。遗憾的是，这个基于 MPI 的 GA "
"版本也并非在所有系统上都稳定，尤其是在大型算例中。此外它还稍慢一些，因为需要额外的进程。自 molpro 2025.2 起，Molpro "
"二进制程序默认使用 ``–with-mpi-pr``\\ 。"

